				"The Nether is quite hot, make sure to insulate your armor."
				""
				"If you have silktouch (you've been working on your gear, right...?) you can create 'cold stones' which naturally lower your body temp if they're in your inventory, be careful though, they melt away after being held onto for too long!"
				""
				"Some food/drink grant '&bCold Food/Drink&r' this &nlowers&r your body temperature, not by much but every little bit counts!"
				"Have you found a brewing stand in the overworld? Great! This will make your life easier as you could brew heat resistance potions; or even better, fire resistance."
				""
				"Heat Resistance makes you slightly more heat immune, where as fire resisance makes you immune."
				""
				"You can insulate your armor with cooling coatings, which will make you more heat resistant."
				""
				"You'll also struggle to breathe, maybe it's time to consider a Reinforced Respirator..?"
				"You can also use a Create Diving Helmet and Backtank."
				""
				"Due to limitations with the Create Mod, insulation applied to backtanks naturally vanishes."
				"EDIT; With the new temperature mod I have not been able to confirm if this is true, let me know!"
				"Don't add your own, it'll vanish when you place your backtank down to recharge it."
				"You have been warned."
			]
